  "label": "vulgar_pun",
  "description": "A vulgar pun is a play on words that uses offensive or crude language for comedic or shocking effect. The text 'and that's why i gas people' is a vulgar pun that equates the Holocaust's use of gas chambers with the modern slang meaning of 'gas' (to release gas), which is offensive and intended to shock or mock.",
